"Drop both files in Cyanide/tweaks/. The Xcode project uses PBXFileSystemSynchronizedRootGroup, so new files are picked up automatically — no pbxproj edits needed." = "把两个文件放进 Cyanide/tweaks/ 即可。本工程使用 PBXFileSystemSynchronizedRootGroup，新文件会被自动纳入，无需改动 pbxproj。";
"Mirror an existing kSettings…Enabled path — search kSettingsStatBarEnabled or kSettingsAxonLiteEnabled for a complete template covering defaults, rows, package state, Run, live apply, stop, and cleanup." = "照抄一条现有的 kSettings…Enabled 路径——搜索 kSettingsStatBarEnabled 或 kSettingsAxonLiteEnabled，可找到覆盖默认值、设置行、包状态、运行、实时应用、停止与清理的完整模板。";
"Read sbcustomizer.m, statbar.m, and axonlite.m in Cyanide/tweaks/ for shipped patterns at increasing complexity." = "阅读 Cyanide/tweaks/ 下的 sbcustomizer.m、statbar.m 和 axonlite.m，可看到复杂度递增的现成范式。";
"Shipped templates: sbcustomizer (dock layout), darksword_tweaks (SpringBoard state toggles), powercuff (thermalmonitord one-shot), statbar (overlay window), axonlite (cached NC state)." = "内置模板：sbcustomizer（Dock 布局）、darksword_tweaks（SpringBoard 状态开关）、powercuff（thermalmonitord 一次性注入）、statbar（悬浮窗口）、axonlite（通知中心状态缓存）。";
"_main variants dispatch to the target main thread (use them for UIKit). _raw passes non-pointer arguments by value. r_msg2_main_struct_ret copies struct returns such as CGRect." = "带 _main 的变体会派发到目标主线程（涉及 UIKit 时用它）。_raw 按值传递非指针参数。r_msg2_main_struct_ret 用于复制 CGRect 等结构体返回值。";
"1.00 = default, 0.50 = 2× faster, 0.25 = 4× faster. Minimum is 0.01." = "1.00 = 默认，0.50 = 快 2 倍，0.25 = 快 4 倍。最小值为 0.01。";
"Always On keeps the Face ID retry pulse and unlock request armed in SpringBoard until Disable, Clean Up, or respring." = "常开会在 SpringBoard 中持续保持 Face ID 重试脉冲与解锁请求，直到关闭、清理或重新载入 SpringBoard。";
"Always On uses this as the off→on pulse gap. Default is 0.3s." = "常开模式下用此值作为“关→开”的脉冲间隔。默认 0.3 秒。";
"Clears the floor; offers a respring to apply." = "清除下限值；可选择重新载入 SpringBoard 使其生效。";
"Defaults to the Watusi WhatsApp duplicate." = "默认为 Watusi 版 WhatsApp 的分身应用。";
"Diagnostic. When an injection wedges, the stuck system-process thread dooms the device to a hardware-watchdog reset within ~2 minutes — which can leave no panic log at all. On instead flushes the log and panics the kernel immediately via KRW: the reboot is instant and always writes a panic-full stamped with the CYANIDE signature address 0x4359414e494445xx. Off keeps the standard abort + restart flow." = "诊断用。注入卡死时，被卡住的系统进程线程会在约 2 分钟内拖垮设备、触发硬件看门狗复位——而且可能完全留不下 panic 日志。开启后会立即刷写日志并通过 KRW 让内核 panic：重启是瞬时的，且一定会写出带 CYANIDE 签名地址 0x4359414e494445xx 的 panic-full。关闭则沿用标准的中止 + 重启流程。";
"Draws app names under the dock icons, which stock iOS leaves off. Unavailable while Hide icon labels is on — the dock follows the home screen." = "在 Dock 图标下方显示应用名称，原生 iOS 默认不显示。开启“隐藏图标标签”时此项不可用——Dock 会跟随主屏幕设置。";
"Experimental. On interleaves the socket spray with search-mapping allocation and scans each mapping tail-first, aiming to find the PCB in fewer reads. Off uses the proven bulk-spray + forward-scan path. A18/M4 only; effective on the next fresh chain run." = "实验性。开启后把 socket spray 与搜索映射的分配交错进行，并从每个映射的尾部开始扫描，目标是用更少的读取找到 PCB。关闭则使用已验证的批量 spray + 正向扫描路径。仅 A18/M4 有效；在下次全新运行时生效。";
"Highest watchOS pairing generation this iPhone will accept. 99 raises the phone-side ceiling for newer watchOS releases." = "此 iPhone 可接受的 watchOS 配对代次上限。设为 99 可为更新的 watchOS 版本抬高手机侧上限。";
"If you respring after Hide Home Bar, run App Switcher Grid again because respring resets this live SpringBoard patch." = "如果启用“隐藏 Home 指示条”后重新载入了 SpringBoard，需要重新运行 App 切换器网格，因为重新载入会重置这个运行时 SpringBoard 补丁。";
"In progress — not wired yet. This blocker is disabled for now." = "开发中——尚未接通。该拦截项目前处于禁用状态。";
"Keeps pickup-to-unlock armed after Cyanide closes." = "Cyanide 关闭后仍保持“拿起即解锁”生效。";
"Leave this alone unless switching between multiple older paired watches is not working." = "除非在多块较老的已配对手表之间切换时出问题，否则不要改动此项。";
"Leave this alone unless you are trying to pair an old S-chip watch, such as a Series 3." = "除非你要配对手表 Series 3 这类老 S 芯片机型，否则不要改动此项。";
"Lets cyanide://location-services links turn Location Services on or off. Any app can open these links without asking, so this is off by default. The Control Center toggle and the Shortcuts action work without it." = "允许通过 cyanide://location-services 链接开关定位服务。任何应用都能直接打开这类链接且不会询问，因此默认关闭。控制中心开关和快捷指令操作不依赖此项。";
"Logs the full RemoteCall internals for every exploit run, tweak apply and Process Viewer action. Off keeps the log readable; turn it on before reproducing an issue, then share the log." = "在每次漏洞利用、应用 tweak 和进程查看器操作时记录完整的 RemoteCall 内部信息。关闭可保持日志易读；复现问题前再打开，然后把日志发出来。";
"Lowest pairing setup generation this iPhone will accept. Keep this at 23 so generation-23 setup messages are not rejected." = "此 iPhone 可接受的配对设置代次下限。保持 23，以免第 23 代设置消息被拒绝。";
"Maximum automatic re-runs after the first miss. Enable Auto-retry failed chain runs to change this." = "首次失败后自动重跑的最大次数。需先开启“自动重试失败的链式运行”才能修改。";
"Moves the selected Home Screen app into a newly available Dock slot when SBCustomizer is applied." = "应用 SBCustomizer 时，把选定的主屏幕应用移入新空出的 Dock 位置。";
"Off hides the Sources tab and repo packages, stops refreshing sources, and skips repo tweaks when applying (running ones are stopped). Local QuickLoader .js files still work." = "关闭后会隐藏“源”标签页与仓库包、停止刷新源，并在应用时跳过仓库 tweak（正在运行的会被停止）。本地 QuickLoader 的 .js 文件仍可用。";
"On re-runs the chain automatically when the exploit misses, up to the attempt cap below — the progress screen just keeps spinning until it lands or the cap is hit. Never retries a wedged injection. Every attempt is an independent panic dice roll, so the cap bounds your exposure per tap." = "开启后漏洞利用失手会自动重跑，直到下方次数上限——进度界面会一直转，直到命中或触顶。卡死的注入不会被重试。每次尝试都是独立的 panic 赌注，上限用于控制每次点击的风险暴露。";
"On stops after 4 search passes and reports a clean retry instead of grinding — which can otherwise end in an aperture panic on a device that never lands the PCB. On (default) stops; Off (legacy, matches 1.5.5) grinds until the exploit acquires. A18/M4 only; effective on the next fresh chain run." = "开启后在 4 轮搜索后停止并干净地报告重试，而不是继续死磕——在某些始终找不到 PCB 的设备上，死磕最终会以 aperture panic 收场。开启（默认）会停止；关闭（旧行为，与 1.5.5 一致）会一直磨到漏洞利用成功。仅 A18/M4 有效；下次全新运行时生效。";
"Required for app-driven live tweaks to persist while minimized, including StatBar receiving fresh live data." = "应用驱动型实时 tweak 需要它才能在最小化后继续工作，包括让 StatBar 持续接收实时数据。";
"Reset can take a few minutes. If location still looks simulated, reboot and wait a little longer." = "重置可能需要几分钟。如果定位看起来仍是模拟的，请重启设备并再多等一会儿。";
"Restores the original switcher style in the active SpringBoard session when available." = "在可用时，于当前 SpringBoard 会话中恢复原生 App 切换器样式。";
"Seconds the lock screen stays awake before it dims and sleeps, while you read notifications. Separate from Settings > Auto-Lock. Default 60, min 5, max 3600. Face ID gaze can keep it on longer." = "锁屏在你阅读通知时保持亮屏、之后变暗并休眠的秒数。与“设置 > 自动锁定”相互独立。默认 60，最小 5，最大 3600。Face ID 注视可让它亮得更久。";
"Shows the floor currently written in SpringBoard. Needs kernel access — run the chain first." = "显示当前写入 SpringBoard 的下限值。需要内核访问权限——请先跑一次链式运行。";
"Starts Gravity Lite right away, without the Apply queue." = "立即启动 Gravity Lite，不经过应用队列。";
"Stops the SpringBoard timers." = "停止 SpringBoard 中的定时器。";
"Stops the physics and puts the icons back." = "停止物理效果并把图标复位。";
"The same system-wide switch as Settings → Privacy & Security → Location Services." = "与“设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 定位服务”是同一个系统级开关。";
"This is a runtime SpringBoard method patch. It does not write system files; respring restores the stock app switcher." = "这是运行时 SpringBoard 方法补丁。它不写入系统文件；重新载入 SpringBoard 即恢复原生 App 切换器。";
"Top and bottom rows move separately. Changes update live while NiceBar Lite is running." = "上下两行分别移动。NiceBar Lite 运行时改动会实时更新。";
"Turn it off in the Installer to bring the stock Dock back; a respring always does." = "在安装器中关闭即可恢复原生 Dock；重新载入 SpringBoard 也总会恢复。";
"Writes the value and offers a respring to apply it." = "写入该值，并提示重新载入 SpringBoard 使其生效。";
"A RemoteCall session is the bridge. From inside one you send Objective-C messages, read and write memory, and call C symbols in the target process." = "RemoteCall 会话就是那座桥。在会话中可以发送 Objective-C 消息、读写内存，并调用目标进程里的 C 符号。";
"A complete RemoteCall-only tweak: paints an 80×80 red square on a SpringBoard window." = "一个完整的纯 RemoteCall tweak：在 SpringBoard 窗口上画一个 80×80 的红色方块。";
"Build with ./scripts/build.sh — the IPA is packaged under build/. Sideload, test on device, attach Log-tab output to your PR." = "用 ./scripts/build.sh 构建——IPA 会打包到 build/ 下。侧载到设备实测，并把日志标签页的输出附在你的 PR 里。";
"Cyanide tweaks are app-side drivers. No SpringBoard dylibs, no Substrate hooks, no swizzled methods. The app reaches into the target from outside." = "Cyanide 的 tweak 是应用侧驱动。没有 SpringBoard dylib、没有 Substrate 钩子、没有 swizzle 方法。应用是从外部伸进目标进程的。";
"Every apply checks g_springboard_rc_ready inside @synchronized(settings_rc_lock()). settings_mark_tweak_applied() keeps package state honest. forget_remote_state() runs on respring and abandon." = "每次应用都会在 @synchronized(settings_rc_lock()) 内检查 g_springboard_rc_ready。settings_mark_tweak_applied() 负责让包状态保持真实。forget_remote_state() 在重新载入 SpringBoard 和放弃时执行。";
"Idempotent on reapply, undoes itself on stop, drops cached pointers on respawn." = "重复应用是幂等的，停止时会自我撤销，进程重生时丢弃缓存的指针。";
"Import remote_objc.h and ../TaskRop/RemoteCall.h. Helpers assume an active session — don't call init_remote_call yourself unless you need a private channel." = "引入 remote_objc.h 和 ../TaskRop/RemoteCall.h。这些辅助函数假定会话已激活——除非需要私有通道，否则不要自己调 init_remote_call。";
"Ports work when the effect is a finite mutation — set this property, call this controller method, add this view, hold this assertion, or refresh on a timer." = "当效果是一次有限改动时才好移植——设置某个属性、调用某个控制器方法、添加某个视图、持有一个断言，或按定时器刷新。";
"RemoteCall isn't a hook framework. You can't intercept a method or replace a C function in place." = "RemoteCall 不是钩子框架。你无法拦截方法，也无法就地替换 C 函数。";
"Settings holds the SpringBoard channel during Apply Tweaks. Your code runs inside it under settings_rc_lock(), via three entrypoints: apply_in_session, optional stop_in_session, and forget_remote_state." = "点击“应用 tweak”期间，设置页持有 SpringBoard 通道。你的代码在 settings_rc_lock() 保护下、经由三个入口在其中运行：apply_in_session、可选的 stop_in_session，以及 forget_remote_state。";
"SettingsViewController.m is the orchestrator. Add five things: a defaults key, a switch row, a Run-path apply, a live-apply branch, and forget_remote_state in cleanup." = "SettingsViewController.m 是编排者。需要加五样东西：一个 defaults 键、一个开关行、一条运行路径的应用逻辑、一个实时应用分支，以及清理时的 forget_remote_state。";
"Source and issues: https://github.com/kolbicz/cyanide" = "源码与问题反馈：https://github.com/kolbicz/cyanide";
"Targeting another process? Open a separate session with init_remote_call(name, false), do the work, destroy_remote_call before switching back. Powercuff does this for thermalmonitord." = "要操作其他进程？用 init_remote_call(name, false) 另开会话，做完后切回前先 destroy_remote_call。Powercuff 对 thermalmonitord 就是这么做的。";
