"Cyanide is a limited tweak environment. Session tweaks reset on reboot, while a few packages intentionally modify local system files and may persist until restored. Backups are best-effort only. Use these tools only where you have permission, understand the legal and service-rule impact, and accept the risk. Live tweaks like StatBar and Axon Lite stop if you force-quit Cyanide. A progress log opens while changes apply; tap Hide to dismiss." = "Cyanide 是一个受限的 tweak 环境。会话型 tweak 会在重启后重置，而少数包会刻意修改本地系统文件，并可能一直保留到被还原。备份仅为尽力而为。请仅在你有权限的场景使用这些工具，理解其法律与服务条款影响，并自行承担风险。StatBar、Axon Lite 这类实时 tweak 会在你强制退出 Cyanide 时停止。应用更改时会打开进度日志，点“隐藏”即可收起。";
