"Adds configurable text labels around the status bar. Slots can show custom text, date/time formats, and system values such as battery, memory, network speed, uptime, IP address, disk space, thermal state, and traffic counters.\n\nPorted from d1y/cyanide-ios." = "在状态栏周围添加可配置的文字标签。每个槽位可显示自定义文字、日期/时间格式，以及电量、内存、网速、运行时间、IP 地址、磁盘空间、热状态、流量计数等系统数值。\n\n移植自 d1y/cyanide-ios。";
"Adds extra padding around the home grid and the dock, and scales icons up or down. Stacks on top of SBCustomizer.\n\nDial in left/right/top/bottom padding for the home screen, horizontal padding for the dock, and home/dock icon scale in the Settings tab. Defaults match stock (zero padding, 100% scale).\n\nApplied at Run; not persisted across respring.\n\niOS 18: mutates the SBIconController layout configuration directly (upstream kolbicz path).\niOS 26: walks the live SBIconListView/SBIconView hierarchy and adjusts frames + iconImageInfo per icon (the iOS 26 layout class is read-only). One-shot at Run on iOS 26 — rotation/page swipe may force iOS 26's auto-layout to re-fit, so re-Run if that happens." = "为主屏幕网格和 Dock 增加额外内边距，并可放大或缩小图标。可与 SBCustomizer 叠加使用。\n\n在设置标签页中调整主屏幕的左/右/上/下内边距、Dock 的水平内边距，以及主屏/Dock 图标缩放。默认值与原生一致（零内边距、100% 缩放）。\n\n在“运行”时应用；重新载入 SpringBoard 后不保留。\n\niOS 18：直接修改 SBIconController 的布局配置（沿用上游 kolbicz 的路径）。\niOS 26：遍历运行中的 SBIconListView/SBIconView 层级，逐个图标调整 frame 与 iconImageInfo（iOS 26 的布局类是只读的）。在 iOS 26 上是“运行”时的一次性操作——旋转或翻页可能触发 iOS 26 自动布局重新适配，若发生请重新运行。";
"Applies a runtime SpringBoard method patch that makes the app switcher use grid/deck style.\n\nThis does not write system files. A respring restores the stock app switcher. If you respring after Hide Home Bar, run App Switcher Grid again because respring resets this live SpringBoard patch.\n\nPorted from d1y/cyanide-ios." = "应用一个运行时 SpringBoard 方法补丁，让 App 切换器使用网格/卡组样式。\n\n它不写入系统文件。重新载入 SpringBoard 即恢复原生切换器。如果启用“隐藏 Home 指示条”后重新载入了 SpringBoard，需要重新运行 App 切换器网格，因为重新载入会重置这个运行时补丁。\n\n移植自 d1y/cyanide-ios。";
"Applies the look set in Settings → Lara → SpringBoard Tools (dock, folders, Control Center, notifications, app switcher) together with the other tweaks, so it comes back with Apply Tweaks after a respring." = "把在“设置 → Lara → SpringBoard 工具”中配置的外观（Dock、文件夹、控制中心、通知、App 切换器）与其他 tweak 一起应用，这样重新载入 SpringBoard 后点击“应用 tweak”即可恢复。";
"Changes the watchOS pairing range saved on this iPhone.\n\nMost people should use watchOS Range 99/23/10/6 in Settings, then apply the override. These are pairing protocol generations, not Apple Watch model numbers. 99 raises the watchOS pairing ceiling. 23 keeps the generation-23 setup protocol accepted. 10 and 6 leave the legacy chip and multi-watch floors at their normal values.\n\nApple Watch Ultra 3 cannot pair on iOS versions below 26 at this time.\n\nSystem-file warning: this modifies the local NanoRegistry compatibility-index MobileAsset and saves a .cyanide.bak backup beside the original file. Pairing-asset edits can fail, partially apply, require a respring or reboot to settle, or leave pairing state inconsistent. You apply or remove this override at your own risk.\n\nRespring or reboot after installing or removing the override before trying to pair." = "修改保存在此 iPhone 上的 watchOS 配对范围。\n\n大多数人应在设置中选择“watchOS 区间 99/23/10/6”，再应用覆盖。这些是配对协议代次，不是 Apple Watch 型号编号。99 抬高 watchOS 配对上限。23 保证第 23 代设置协议仍被接受。10 和 6 让旧芯片与多手表的下限保持正常值。\n\n目前 Apple Watch Ultra 3 无法在低于 iOS 26 的版本上配对。\n\n系统文件警告：本操作会修改本地的 NanoRegistry 兼容性索引 MobileAsset，并在原文件旁保存 .cyanide.bak 备份。配对资源修改可能失败、只部分生效、需要重新载入或重启才能稳定，或导致配对状态不一致。应用或移除本覆盖风险自负。\n\n安装或移除覆盖后，请先重新载入 SpringBoard 或重启，再尝试配对。";
"Customizes the dock icon count and the home screen icon grid (columns and rows). It can move a selected app into a newly available Dock slot, optionally hide icon labels, and apply separate icon capacities to the first and remaining Home Screen pages.\n\nThe Watusi WhatsApp duplicate is selected by default for the optional Dock move; enter another app's bundle identifier in Settings to change it." = "自定义 Dock 图标数量和主屏幕图标网格（列数与行数）。它可以把选定的应用移入新空出的 Dock 位置，可选隐藏图标标签，并为首页与其余页面分别设置图标容量。\n\n可选的 Dock 移动默认选中 Watusi 版 WhatsApp 的分身应用；在设置中输入其他应用的 Bundle ID 即可更改。";
"Cuts the backlight fade duration to zero so the display switches on or off instantly on lock and unlock." = "把背光渐变时长归零，让屏幕在锁屏和解锁时瞬间点亮或熄灭。";
"Disables or enables the launchd jobs responsible for over-the-air system updates by editing disabled.plist. State persists across reboots.\n\nSystem-file warning: this edits /private/var/db/com.apple.xpc.launchd/disabled.plist. Incorrect or partial writes can affect launchd job state across boot. You disable or re-enable OTA updates at your own risk.\n\nThis is a manual tool, not a queued package. Open Controls, then tap Disable OTA Updates to block them or Enable OTA Updates to restore them; the change is written immediately, with no Run or Apply step. Read Current Status reports whether the update daemons are currently blocked.\n\nRun the chain at least once first so kernel access is active — Read Current Status will not start it on its own.\n\nVersion 1.2 moves the controls into Settings; 1.1 added Read Current Status." = "通过编辑 disabled.plist 关闭或启用负责 OTA 系统更新的 launchd 任务。状态在重启后保留。\n\n系统文件警告：本操作会编辑 /private/var/db/com.apple.xpc.launchd/disabled.plist。写入错误或不完整可能影响跨启动的 launchd 任务状态。关闭或重新启用 OTA 更新风险自负。\n\n这是手动工具，不是队列中的软件包。打开“控制”，点“屏蔽 OTA 更新”即可拦截，点“启用 OTA 更新”即可恢复；改动会立即写入，没有运行或应用步骤。“读取当前状态”会报告更新守护进程当前是否被拦截。\n\n请先至少跑一次链式运行，让内核访问处于激活状态——“读取当前状态”不会自行启动它。\n\n1.2 版把控件移入设置页；1.1 版新增“读取当前状态”。";
"Displays real-time download and upload speed in a compact SpringBoard status-bar overlay. Pick its corner or center position in Settings.\n\nPorted from d1y/cyanide-ios." = "在紧凑的 SpringBoard 状态栏浮层中实时显示下载与上传速度。可在设置中选择它停靠在角落还是居中。\n\n移植自 d1y/cyanide-ios。";
"Double-tap an empty area of the Home Screen or Lock Screen background to lock the device. Version 1.1 excludes icons and the passcode screen, fixing accidental locks while opening apps or entering a passcode." = "双击主屏幕或锁屏背景的空白区域即可锁定设备。1.1 版排除了图标与密码输入界面，修复了打开应用或输入密码时的误锁。";
"Drives thermalmonitord with synthetic thermal pressure to underclock the CPU and GPU. Useful for cooling-sensitive workloads or extending runtime under load. Effects persist until reboot.\n\nNominal is the daily-use default. Light, Moderate, and Heavy intentionally underclock the CPU more, so lag and slower app launches mean it is working as intended. Those levels can be too slow for comfortable day-to-day use, especially on older devices.\n\nPick a level in the Settings tab." = "向 thermalmonitord 施加合成的热压力，从而降低 CPU 与 GPU 频率。适合对温度敏感的任务，或在高负载下延长续航。效果持续到重启。\n\n“标称”是日常使用的默认值。“轻度”“中度”“重度”会有意更大幅度降频，所以出现卡顿、应用启动变慢说明它正在按设计工作。这些级别可能慢到不适合日常使用，在老设备上尤其明显。\n\n在设置标签页中选择级别。";
"Extends the lock screen's own dim-then-sleep timer — the short countdown that turns the screen off while you read notifications, separate from Settings > Auto-Lock.\n\nThis is a manual tool, not a queued package. Open Controls, set the number of seconds, then tap Apply Lock Screen Duration. It writes the SpringBoard preference SBMinimumLockscreenIdleTime (a global floor applied to every lock-screen idle state, including after Face ID) and offers a respring to apply it. The value persists across respring and reboot. Use Remove to restore stock timing, or Read Current Value to see what is configured.\n\nMechanism: -[SBIdleTimerDescriptorFactory sanitizeDescriptorForLockscreenDefaults:] floors every lock-screen interval with max(interval, minimumLockscreenIdleTime). Face ID gaze (Attention Aware) can keep the screen on even longer.\n\nRun the chain at least once first so kernel access is active. Takes effect on the next respring." = "延长锁屏自带的“变暗后休眠”计时器——也就是你阅读通知时那段让屏幕熄灭的短倒计时，与“设置 > 自动锁定”相互独立。\n\n这是手动工具，不是队列中的软件包。打开“控制”，设置秒数，然后点“应用锁屏显示时长”。它会写入 SpringBoard 偏好项 SBMinimumLockscreenIdleTime（对所有锁屏空闲状态生效的全局下限，Face ID 之后同样适用），并提示重新载入 SpringBoard 使其生效。该值在重新载入和重启后都会保留。用“移除”恢复原生计时，用“读取当前值”查看当前配置。\n\n原理：-[SBIdleTimerDescriptorFactory sanitizeDescriptorForLockscreenDefaults:] 会用 max(interval, minimumLockscreenIdleTime) 为每个锁屏间隔设定下限。Face ID 注视（注意力感知）可以让屏幕亮得更久。\n\n请先至少跑一次链式运行，让内核访问处于激活状态。下次重新载入 SpringBoard 时生效。";
"Groups visible Notification Center requests by app in a SpringBoard overlay and filters duplicates while Cyanide keeps the RemoteCall session alive.\n\nNo extra configuration." = "在 SpringBoard 浮层中把可见的通知中心请求按应用分组，并在 Cyanide 保持 RemoteCall 会话存活期间过滤重复项。\n\n无需额外配置。";
"Imports SnowBoard/IconBundles themes into a local library and applies the selected theme through Cyanide's icon replacement pipeline. Supports the bundled iOS 6 theme and local folder imports.\n\nSnowBoard Lite is the main icon-theme entry point in Cyanide.\n\nPorted from d1y/cyanide-ios." = "把 SnowBoard/IconBundles 主题导入本地库，并通过 Cyanide 的图标替换流程应用所选主题。支持内置的 iOS 6 主题和本地文件夹导入。\n\nSnowBoard Lite 是 Cyanide 中图标主题的主要入口。\n\n移植自 d1y/cyanide-ios。";
"Installs an overlay window in SpringBoard that shows live battery temperature and free RAM next to the system status bar. Refresh timing is adjustable so you can trade live updates for battery life.\n\nConfigure units, visible metrics, and refresh speed in the Settings tab." = "在 SpringBoard 中安装一个浮层窗口，在系统状态栏旁显示实时电池温度与可用内存。刷新间隔可调，便于用实时性换续航。\n\n在设置标签页中配置单位、显示项与刷新速度。";
"Overrides _UIAnimationDragCoefficient in SpringBoard to make all UIKit spring animations faster or slower.\n\nSet the coefficient in the Drag Coefficient settings panel. 50% = 0.50× (2× faster), 25% = 0.25× (4× faster), 100% = stock.\n\nImported from kolbicz/DarkSword-Tweaks." = "覆盖 SpringBoard 中的 _UIAnimationDragCoefficient，让所有 UIKit 弹性动画变快或变慢。\n\n在拖拽系数设置面板中设定系数。50% = 0.50×（快 2 倍），25% = 0.25×（快 4 倍），100% = 原生。\n\n来自 kolbicz/DarkSword-Tweaks。";
"Plays a selected MP4/MOV/M4V video behind SpringBoard's home and lock screen windows while Cyanide keeps the RemoteCall session alive.\n\nPorted from d1y/cyanide-ios." = "在 SpringBoard 的主屏幕与锁屏窗口之后播放选定的 MP4/MOV/M4V 视频，前提是 Cyanide 保持 RemoteCall 会话存活。\n\n移植自 d1y/cyanide-ios。";
"RemoteCall-only port of the usable FastLockX primitives recovered from the iOS 15 tweak by Artem Kasper.\n\nCredits: original FastLockX by Artem Kasper; Cyanide FastLockX Lite port by zeroxjf.\n\nIt can pulse SpringBoard's biometric retry path, ask the iOS 26 biometric coordinator to start a Mesa/Face ID unlock, and send the original Lock Screen unlock request as a fallback. Installing it through Apply Tweaks keeps those retry/unlock requests armed with SpringBoard timers so pickup-to-unlock can work after Cyanide closes. The pulse loop pauses again after unlock.\n\nUse Disable, Clean Up, or a respring to stop the timers." = "纯 RemoteCall 移植版，取自 Artem Kasper 的 iOS 15 tweak 中可用的 FastLockX 原语。\n\n致谢：FastLockX 原作者 Artem Kasper；Cyanide 版 FastLockX Lite 移植由 zeroxjf 完成。\n\n它可以脉冲触发 SpringBoard 的生物识别重试路径，请求 iOS 26 生物识别协调器发起 Mesa/Face ID 解锁，并在必要时回退为原始的锁屏解锁请求。通过“应用 tweak”安装后，这些重试/解锁请求会由 SpringBoard 定时器保持待命，使 Cyanide 关闭后“拿起即解锁”仍可工作。解锁后脉冲循环会再次暂停。\n\n使用“关闭”“清理”或重新载入 SpringBoard 来停止定时器。";
"Removes the App Library page that sits past your last home-screen page. Swiping past the last page becomes a no-op.\n\nWorks on iOS 17 and later." = "移除位于最后一页主屏幕之后的 App 资源库页面。滑过最后一页将不再有任何效果。\n\n支持 iOS 17 及更高版本。";
"Removes the blue dot iOS shows next to the names of newly installed and recently updated apps, and keeps new ones from appearing until the next respring." = "移除 iOS 在新安装和最近更新应用名称旁显示的蓝点，并在下次重新载入 SpringBoard 前阻止新蓝点出现。";
"Removes the fade-in animation when waking the display. The screen pops on at full brightness immediately." = "移除唤醒屏幕时的淡入动画。屏幕会立即以全亮度亮起。";
"Replaces the CallServices StartDisclosureWithTone and StopDisclosure audio files with Cyanide's bundled silent payloads.\n\nCredits: YangJiiii (@duongduong0908) for the EnsWilde and Disable Call Recording BookRestore reference tools. @Little_34306 is credited by the original projects for the Disable Call Recording concept. Cyanide port, KRW-backed implementation, and generated replacement silent audio assets by zeroxjf.\n\nSystem-file warning: this modifies files under /var/mobile/Library/CallServices/Greetings/default. Cyanide backs up the first originals into its app container, but system file replacement can fail, partially apply, or require a respring/reboot to settle.\n\nLegal note: call-recording disclosure sounds may exist to satisfy consent, notification, or privacy-law requirements in some places. You are responsible for understanding and following the laws that apply to you.\n\nThis port does not use the old Books/BookRestore/sparserestore path. Cyanide runs KRW, unlocks local /private/var write access, then writes directly to the CallServices files.\n\nUse Restore Original Sounds to write Cyanide's backups back when present. You apply or restore this tweak at your own risk." = "用 Cyanide 内置的静音音频替换 CallServices 的 StartDisclosureWithTone 与 StopDisclosure 音频文件。\n\n致谢：YangJiiii（@duongduong0908）提供的 EnsWilde 与 Disable Call Recording BookRestore 参考工具。@Little_34306 被原项目列为“禁用通话录音提示音”概念的提出者。Cyanide 移植版、基于 KRW 的实现与生成的替换静音音频均由 zeroxjf 完成。\n\n系统文件警告：本操作会修改 /var/mobile/Library/CallServices/Greetings/default 下的文件。Cyanide 会把最初的原始文件备份到自己的应用容器中，但系统文件替换仍可能失败、只部分生效，或需要重新载入/重启才能稳定。\n\n法律提示：在某些地区，通话录音提示音是为满足知情同意、告知或隐私法要求而存在的。理解并遵守适用于你的法律是你的责任。\n\n本移植版不使用旧的 Books/BookRestore/sparserestore 路径。Cyanide 会运行 KRW，解锁本地 /private/var 写权限，然后直接写入 CallServices 文件。\n\n在备份存在时，可用“恢复原始提示音”把 Cyanide 的备份写回。应用或还原本 tweak 风险自负。";
"Replaces the Lock Screen keypad artwork under /var/mobile/Library/Caches/TelephonyUI-* with a style you import or build in the Passcode Style panel. A style may cover only some digits; the rest stay stock.\n\nOpen Controls to apply it or restore the saved originals. Lock and unlock (or respring) to see the change.\n\nSystem-file warning: the originals Cyanide saves live in Cyanide's own app container, so reinstalling Cyanide deletes them — export them from the Passcode Style panel first if you plan to reinstall.\n\nCredits: ported from the Passcode implementation created for Lara by ruter and neonmodder123, inherited and extended by leonardob8777-bit in Eagle (https://github.com/leonardob8777-bit/Eagle, AGPL-3.0). Cyanide port by FleetingDreamso." = "用你在密码界面样式面板中导入或制作的样式，替换 /var/mobile/Library/Caches/TelephonyUI-* 下的锁屏键盘图案。样式可以只覆盖部分数字，其余保持原生。\n\n打开“控制”即可应用或还原已保存的原始文件。锁定再解锁（或重新载入 SpringBoard）即可看到变化。\n\n系统文件警告：Cyanide 保存的原始文件位于它自己的应用容器内，因此重装 Cyanide 会把它们删掉——如果打算重装，请先从密码界面样式面板导出。\n\n致谢：移植自 ruter 与 neonmodder123 为 Lara 实现的 Passcode 功能，后由 leonardob8777-bit 在 Eagle 中继承并扩展（https://github.com/leonardob8777-bit/Eagle，AGPL-3.0）。Cyanide 移植由 FleetingDreamso 完成。";
"Run two apps as floating, resizable windows on top of SpringBoard.\n\nBased on Dynamic Stage by tomt000 — the original Stage Manager-for-iPhone tweak. Dynamic Stage Lite is an independent, RemoteCall-only re-implementation of the split-view + scene-hosting design; no original tweak code or assets are reused. Go check out tomt000's full version on Havoc.\n\nHow to use:\n• Tap the dot in the bottom-right corner of the screen to open the picker.\n• Tap two apps to launch them side-by-side.\n• Drag the top bar to move; drag any corner to resize.\n• X in the top-left of a window closes it.\n• Gear in the picker tray jumps back to Cyanide settings.\n\nFirst Run is slow. The picker has to enumerate every installed app over RemoteCall and build a tile per app — expect 1-2 minutes on a fresh install. Re-Runs reuse the cache and are fast.\n\nRough edges:\n• Touch routing into hosted apps isn't wired — windows are for viewing/switching, not scrolling or typing.\n• Auto-close on full-screen launch is not yet hooked up; close manually with the X.\n• Gestures may stutter while the App Library is still filling in." = "把两个应用作为可调整大小的浮动窗口运行在 SpringBoard 之上。\n\n基于 tomt000 的 Dynamic Stage——iPhone 上最早的分屏管理器 tweak。Dynamic Stage Lite 是对“分屏视图 + 场景托管”设计的独立重实现，仅用 RemoteCall，未复用原 tweak 的任何代码或资源。建议去看看 tomt000 在 Havoc 上的完整版。\n\n使用方法：\n• 点屏幕右下角的小圆点打开选择器。\n• 点选两个应用即可并排启动。\n• 拖动顶栏移动窗口；拖任意角调整大小。\n• 点窗口左上角的 X 关闭。\n• 选择器托盘里的齿轮可跳回 Cyanide 设置。\n\n首次运行较慢。选择器需要通过 RemoteCall 枚举所有已安装应用并为每个应用生成一个磁贴——全新安装时预计要 1–2 分钟。再次运行会复用缓存，很快。\n\n已知粗糙之处：\n• 尚未接通向宿主应用的路由触摸——窗口只能用于查看/切换，不能滚动或输入。\n• 全屏启动时的自动关闭还没接上；请用 X 手动关闭。\n• App 资源库仍在填充时手势可能卡顿。";
"Select a local JavaScript file from Files, configure any declared parameters, and run it through Cyanide's SpringBoard RemoteCall bridge.\n\nOnly run scripts you trust. JavaScript tweaks can send private SpringBoard messages and destabilize the device if the script is buggy." = "从“文件”中选择本地 JavaScript 文件，配置它声明的参数，然后通过 Cyanide 的 SpringBoard RemoteCall 桥运行。\n\n请只运行你信任的脚本。JavaScript tweak 可以发送 SpringBoard 私有消息，脚本有 bug 时会让设备不稳定。";
"Skips the spring animation that plays when home screen icons appear after unlock or app switch. Icons just appear in their final position." = "跳过解锁或切换应用后主屏幕图标出现时的弹性动画。图标会直接出现在最终位置。";
"Spoofs the device's GPS location via Apple's CLSimulationManager. Requires Apple Maps installed and set up — Maps is the RemoteCall host process that drives the simulation.\n\nThis is a manual tool, not an installable package. Open Controls, choose a target, then use Simulate Current Target or Restore Real Location. Each run opens the activity log and marks completion when the request returns. Reset may take a few minutes and may require a reboot plus extra wait time.\n\nSettings exposes the current target plus altitude and accuracy. v1 is static-point only; route playback and alternate daemon hosts are next.\n\nNot all apps respect the simulated location. Apps that use their own location validation or additional signals may ignore it.\n\nCredits: kolbicz provided the GPS spoofer RemoteCall/CLSimulationManager prototype this is based on. ezzuldinSt's LSpoof provided the app-side CLLocationManager spoofing, picker, bookmarks, and route-simulation reference.\n\nSystem-behavior warning: simulated locations can affect more than maps. Features tied to location, including time zone, date/time behavior, weather, automation, reminders, and service checks, may behave unexpectedly. Only use this if you know what you're doing.\n\nLegal and service-use note: simulated locations may violate app terms, platform rules, game rules, ride-share or delivery policies, or local law depending on how they are used. Use only where you have permission. You are responsible for your use and apply or restore this tweak at your own risk." = "通过 Apple 的 CLSimulationManager 伪造设备 GPS 定位。需要安装并配置好 Apple 地图——地图是驱动模拟的 RemoteCall 宿主进程。\n\n这是手动工具，不是可安装的软件包。打开“控制”，选择目标，然后用“模拟当前目标”或“恢复真实定位”。每次运行都会打开活动日志，请求返回后标记完成。重置可能需要几分钟，也可能需要重启并额外等待。\n\n设置中可查看当前目标以及海拔和精度。v1 仅支持静态点；路线回放和替代守护进程宿主是后续计划。\n\n并非所有应用都遵循模拟定位。使用自家定位校验或额外信号的应用可能会忽略它。\n\n致谢：kolbicz 提供了本功能所基于的 GPS 伪造 RemoteCall/CLSimulationManager 原型。ezzuldinSt 的 LSpoof 提供了应用侧 CLLocationManager 伪造、选择器、书签和路线模拟的参考。\n\n系统行为警告：模拟定位的影响不止于地图。与定位相关的功能，包括时区、日期/时间行为、天气、自动化、提醒和服务检查，都可能出现异常。只在你清楚后果时使用。\n\n法律与服务条款提示：视使用方式不同，模拟定位可能违反应用条款、平台规则、游戏规则、网约车或配送政策，或当地法律。请仅在你有权限的场景使用。你对使用行为负责，应用或还原本 tweak 风险自负。";
"Turns the Dock into SpringBoard's own iPad-style Dock, including the App Library button, for the current SpringBoard session.\n\nWrites no system files. Turning it off brings the stock Dock back; so does a respring. Works together with Disable App Library: the App Library is then only in the Dock.\n\nPorted from hxhlb/cyanide." = "在当前 SpringBoard 会话中，把 Dock 变成 SpringBoard 自带的 iPad 风格 Dock，包含 App 资源库按钮。\n\n不写入任何系统文件。关闭即可恢复原生 Dock；重新载入 SpringBoard 也一样。可与“禁用 App 资源库”配合：此时 App 资源库只存在于 Dock 中。\n\n移植自 hxhlb/cyanide。";
"Zeros the first page of /System/Library/PrivateFrameworks/MaterialKit.framework/Assets.car using Cyanide's stable file-page zero path, which hides the bottom home indicator after SpringBoard reloads assets.\n\nRun Hide Home Bar by itself, then respring so SpringBoard refreshes the asset cache. To bring the home indicator back, choose Restore Home Bar and respring again. Other live SpringBoard tweaks, such as App Switcher Grid, should be applied in a separate run after the respring.\n\nCredits: C4ndyF1sh/ZeroCalories for the Home Bar target and jailbreakdotparty/dirtyZero for the original page-zeroing idea. Cyanide port by zeroxjf." = "用 Cyanide 稳定的“文件页清零”路径把 /System/Library/PrivateFrameworks/MaterialKit.framework/Assets.car 的第一页清零，SpringBoard 重新加载资源后即可隐藏底部 Home 指示条。\n\n请单独运行“隐藏 Home 指示条”，然后重新载入 SpringBoard，让它刷新资源缓存。要恢复 Home 指示条，选择“恢复 Home 指示条”并再次重新载入。其他运行时 SpringBoard tweak（例如 App 切换器网格）应在重新载入之后另起一次运行来应用。\n\n致谢：Home Bar 目标来自 C4ndyF1sh/ZeroCalories，“文件页清零”的原始思路来自 jailbreakdotparty/dirtyZero。Cyanide 移植由 zeroxjf 完成。";
"A SpringBoard/launchd injection deadlocked and the init watchdog aborted it cleanly. Cyanide is safe — but the stuck system-process thread cannot be recovered, so the device will very likely reboot on its own within ~2 minutes.\n\nSave anything open and restart the iPhone proactively; a controlled reboot beats the watchdog's. Then relaunch Cyanide (no new injection channels can open in this session)." = "一次 SpringBoard/launchd 注入发生死锁，init 看门狗已将其干净地中止。Cyanide 本身是安全的——但卡住的系统进程线程无法恢复，因此设备很可能在约 2 分钟内自行重启。\n\n请保存好手头内容并主动重启 iPhone；受控重启比看门狗触发的重启更可控。之后重新启动 Cyanide（本次会话中已无法再打开新的注入通道）。";
"A link asked Cyanide to change Location Services. Links are off, so nothing was changed. Use the Control Center toggle or the Shortcuts action instead, or turn on Settings → Launch Options → Location Services links." = "有链接请求 Cyanide 更改定位服务。该功能处于关闭状态，因此没有做任何改动。请改用控制中心开关或快捷指令操作，或在“设置 → 启动选项 → 定位服务链接”中开启。";
"Adds this phone's product type to the local NanoRegistry compatibility-index MobileAsset and saves a .cyanide.bak backup beside the original file." = "把此手机的产品类型加入本地 NanoRegistry 兼容性索引 MobileAsset，并在原文件旁保存 .cyanide.bak 备份。";
"An install is still running." = "仍有安装正在进行。";
"Apply the style to write it over the keypad art." = "应用该样式，即可把它写入键盘图案。";
"Are you sure you want to respring? SpringBoard will restart." = "确定要重新载入吗？SpringBoard 将重启。";
"Cache Cleaner cannot tell which apps are active without kernel access. Run the chain once, then try again." = "没有内核访问权限时，缓存清理无法判断哪些应用正在使用。请先跑一次链式运行，再重试。";
"Cache Cleaner removes the contents of each app's Library/Caches and tmp folders, plus optional CrashReporter logs. Documents, settings, logins and other app data are not touched. Active apps are checked again before each folder. Detection is best-effort; close apps before cleaning.\n\nWhat can happen:\n• Apps load slower at first and use data to rebuild their caches.\n• Some apps keep offline content (music, podcasts, maps, game data) in their cache. It has to be downloaded again — check large caches before cleaning.\n• Rarely, an app asks you to sign in again or loses an unsent draft.\n• An app waiting in the background may crash once when you return to it.\n\nReported sizes are logical file sizes; actual recovered storage can differ. Apps refill their caches as you use them." = "缓存清理会移除各应用 Library/Caches 与 tmp 文件夹中的内容，以及可选的 CrashReporter 日志。文稿、设置、登录信息和其他应用数据不会被触碰。每个文件夹清理前都会重新检查应用是否在用。检测为尽力而为；清理前请先关闭应用。\n\n可能出现的情况：\n• 应用首次加载会变慢，并消耗流量重建缓存。\n• 部分应用把离线内容（音乐、播客、地图、游戏数据）放在缓存里，需要重新下载——清理前请检查大缓存。\n• 少数情况下应用会要求重新登录，或丢失未发送的草稿。\n• 后台等待的应用在你返回时可能崩溃一次。\n\n显示的容量是逻辑文件大小，实际回收的空间可能不同。应用在使用过程中会重新填充缓存。";
"Choose an MP4, MOV, or M4V video." = "请选择 MP4、MOV 或 M4V 视频。";
"Choose the weather display language." = "选择天气显示语言。";
"Copied to clipboard" = "已拷贝到剪贴板";
"Could not write the setting. Run the chain first, then try again." = "无法写入该设置。请先跑一次链式运行，再重试。";
"Cyanide couldn't ask the system to reboot. It needs kernel access from an earlier Run; run Cyanide, then try again, or restart the device yourself. Details are in the log." = "Cyanide 无法请求系统重启。这需要先前一次运行留下的内核访问权限；请先运行 Cyanide 再试，或自行重启设备。详情见日志。";
"Cyanide now defaults to the Fastest apply speed, which cuts the wait between remote calls. Switch to Fastest? You can change this any time in Settings → Launch Options." = "Cyanide 现在默认使用最快应用速度，可缩短远程调用之间的等待。要切换到“最快”吗？随时可在“设置 → 启动选项”中更改。";
"Cyanide saves a keypad original the first time a style writes over it. Nothing has been saved yet — apply a style first, then export before reinstalling Cyanide." = "Cyanide 会在样式首次覆盖键盘时保存一份原始文件。目前还没有保存任何内容——请先应用一个样式，然后在重装 Cyanide 前导出。";
"Deactivates every package and clears pending changes. Already-applied patches stay until respring or reboot. Per-tweak settings are not affected." = "停用所有软件包并清除待处理的更改。已应用的补丁会保留到重新载入或重启。各 tweak 的设置不受影响。";
"Delete, rename, create, import and edit will write directly to the file system as user mobile. Removing or editing the wrong file can break apps or settings, and there is no undo.\n\nStays on until you lock it again or Cyanide restarts." = "删除、重命名、新建、导入和编辑都会以 mobile 用户身份直接写入文件系统。删除或修改错误的文件可能破坏应用或设置，且无法撤销。\n\n该模式会一直开启，直到你再次锁定或 Cyanide 重启。";
"Discard all pending activation / deactivation changes." = "放弃所有待处理的启用/停用更改。";
"Enter a plain number, then try again." = "请输入纯数字后重试。";
"Enter decimal degrees, or paste a pair like 40.7128, -74.0060 or 北纬39.9042，东经116.4074." = "请输入十进制度数，或粘贴成对的坐标，例如 40.7128, -74.0060 或 北纬39.9042，东经116.4074。";
"Hide Home Bar edits the system home-indicator asset and needs a respring after it applies. Remove the other pending changes, run Hide Home Bar by itself, then apply other tweaks after the respring." = "隐藏 Home 指示条会修改系统的 Home 指示条资源，生效后需要重新载入 SpringBoard。请先移除其他待处理的更改，单独运行“隐藏 Home 指示条”，重新载入后再应用其他 tweak。";
"How often should the process list refresh itself?" = "进程列表多久刷新一次？";
"Import a .passthm / ZIP style below, or tap a key in the preview to pick that digit's photo, then apply again." = "在下方导入 .passthm / ZIP 样式，或在预览中点某个按键为该数字选择图片，然后再次应用。";
"Makes a decrypted IPA of this app for your own use (e.g. tweak injection and sideloading). It can take a while for large apps; keep Cyanide open." = "为这个应用生成解密后的 IPA 供你自己使用（例如注入 tweak 并侧载）。大型应用可能需要较长时间；请让 Cyanide 保持打开。";
"Navigate into your theme folder so you can see IconBundles inside, then tap Open.\n\nIf tapping Open does nothing, your signing tool may need \"Match provisioning identifier\" enabled, or you can use Import Theme Archive instead." = "进入你的主题文件夹，直到能看到其中的 IconBundles，然后点“打开”。\n\n如果点“打开”没有反应，你的签名工具可能需要启用“Match provisioning identifier”，或者改用“导入主题归档”。";
"Navigate into your theme folder so you can see the PNG files inside, then tap Open in the top-right corner to import the folder." = "进入你的主题文件夹，直到能看到其中的 PNG 文件，然后点右上角的“打开”导入该文件夹。";
"No matching container was found for this app." = "未找到该应用对应的容器。";
"No originals are saved on this device. Styles applied by another app are not covered by Cyanide's originals." = "此设备上没有保存任何原始文件。由其他应用应用的样式不在 Cyanide 的原始文件覆盖范围内。";
"No saved originals are on this device." = "此设备上没有已保存的原始文件。";
"Nuking old scripts and downloading the latest..." = "正在清除旧脚本并下载最新版本…";
"Paste an HTTPS RepoTweaks JSON URL." = "请粘贴 RepoTweaks 的 HTTPS JSON 地址。";
"Paste the RAW link to your packages.json" = "粘贴你 packages.json 的 RAW 链接";
"Pick a .passthm style or a ZIP of keypad digit art — a .passthm is the same archive under another extension. An export of the saved originals works too. The art is copied into Cyanide's library; the file you pick stays untouched." = "选择一个 .passthm 样式或包含键盘数字图案的 ZIP——.passthm 就是同一归档换个扩展名。导出的原始文件也可以。图案会被拷贝进 Cyanide 的库，你选的文件本身不会被改动。";
"Pick a ZIP or DEB file that contains an IconBundles directory. Cyanide extracts and imports a local copy." = "选择包含 IconBundles 目录的 ZIP 或 DEB 文件。Cyanide 会解压并导入一份本地副本。";
"Process Viewer, File Browser, Daemon Manager, Cache Cleaner and System Info can use it now." = "进程查看器、文件浏览器、守护进程管理、缓存清理和系统信息现在都可以使用它。";
"Removes the saved Watch Pairing Override without touching the rest of your watch data. Respring or reboot afterwards." = "移除已保存的手表配对覆盖，不会触碰其余手表数据。之后请重新载入 SpringBoard 或重启。";
"Run a chain once, then come back to share the latest diagnostic log." = "请先跑一次链式运行，再回来分享最新的诊断日志。";
"Saves these watchOS pairing settings on this iPhone. Respring or reboot afterwards before trying to pair." = "把这些 watchOS 配对设置保存到此 iPhone。之后请先重新载入 SpringBoard 或重启，再尝试配对。";
"Set up Mail in iOS Settings to send feedback, or DM @_kolbicz on Twitter. View Log in Settings to copy the latest diagnostic log." = "请在 iOS 设置中配置邮件后发送反馈，或在 Twitter 上私信 @_kolbicz。可在设置中“查看日志”以拷贝最新的诊断日志。";
"Silencing call-recording disclosure sounds may violate consent, notice, or privacy laws where you live or where the call participants are located. Only use this where you have permission and understand the rules that apply to you.\n\nCyanide modifies CallServices system files and keeps a backup when possible. You can restore the original sounds from this package." = "静音通话录音提示音，可能违反你所在地区或通话参与者所在地区的知情同意、告知或隐私法律。请仅在你有权限且理解适用规则的场景使用。\n\nCyanide 会修改 CallServices 系统文件，并在可能时保留备份。你可以从本软件包恢复原始提示音。";
"Stops live SpringBoard sessions and closes local KRW state. The next Run will try recovery first." = "停止运行中的 SpringBoard 会话并关闭本地 KRW 状态。下次运行会先尝试恢复。";
"That item is not a photo. Choose an image for the keypad digit." = "该项目不是照片。请为键盘数字选择一张图片。";
"The device restarts. Live tweaks stop first; Run Cyanide again after the restart." = "设备将重启。实时 tweak 会先停止；重启后请重新运行 Cyanide。";
"The file is reloaded as it is on disk." = "将按磁盘上的当前内容重新载入文件。";
"The file was changed or replaced since you opened it. Overwrite it with your version, or Revert to load the current one?" = "该文件在你打开后已被更改或替换。要用你的版本覆盖，还是还原为当前磁盘上的版本？";
"The file was changed or replaced since you opened it. Overwrite it with your version?" = "该文件在你打开后已被更改或替换。要用你的版本覆盖吗？";
"The list of disabled daemons could not be read. Check the log." = "无法读取已关闭守护进程的列表。请查看日志。";
"The process identity couldn't be verified (it may have exited), so nothing was signalled." = "无法验证该进程的身份（它可能已退出），因此没有发送任何信号。";
"The selected item could not be accessed. Try picking from a different location or file provider." = "无法访问所选项目。请尝试从其他位置或文件提供方选择。";
"These services are used by other parts of iOS. Disabling them is more likely to break things or, in the worst case, stop the device from starting. A restore would then install the newest iOS, which Cyanide most likely doesn't support." = "这些服务被 iOS 的其他部分使用。关闭它们更容易出问题，最坏情况下会导致设备无法启动。届时只能通过恢复来修复，而那会安装最新的 iOS，Cyanide 很可能不支持。";
"This iOS build doesn't expose alternate icon switching." = "此 iOS 版本不提供备用图标切换功能。";
"This version adds pe_v3, a newer exploit method for A18 / M4 devices. It probably causes fewer reboots: it stops early instead of reading memory that is likely to panic the device, and retries cleanly instead.\n\nSwitch to pe_v3? You can change this any time in Settings → Launch Options → A18 exploit path." = "此版本新增了 pe_v3，一种面向 A18 / M4 设备的更新漏洞利用方式。它大概能减少重启：遇到很可能让设备 panic 的内存时它会提前停止，改为干净地重试。\n\n要切换到 pe_v3 吗？随时可在“设置 → 启动选项 → A18 漏洞利用路径”中更改。";
"Turning off system daemons changes how iOS starts, at every boot. The services listed here are widely disabled without problems, but that isn't guaranteed for every iOS version and device.\n\nIf iOS can't finish starting, Cyanide can't undo the change. Only a restore fixes it: it erases the device unless you have a backup, and it installs the newest iOS, which Cyanide most likely doesn't support.\n\nBack up first, change one thing at a time and restart to check it before the next." = "关闭系统守护进程会改变 iOS 每次启动的方式。这里列出的服务被广泛关闭且未出问题，但并非在每个 iOS 版本和设备上都有保证。\n\n如果 iOS 无法完成启动，Cyanide 无法撤销该更改。只有恢复才能修复：除非你有备份，否则会抹掉设备，并安装最新的 iOS，而 Cyanide 很可能不支持。\n\n请先备份，一次只改一项，重启验证后再改下一项。";
"Use decimal degrees. Latitude must be between -90 and 90. Longitude must be between -180 and 180. Chinese labels like 北纬/南纬/东经/西经 and full-width punctuation are supported." = "请使用十进制度数。纬度需在 -90 到 90 之间，经度需在 -180 到 180 之间。支持“北纬/南纬/东经/西经”等中文标注及全角标点。";
