"Imported from DarkSword-Tweaks. These are SpringBoard memory patches: one you turn off stays active until the next respring." = "从 DarkSword-Tweaks 导入。这些是 SpringBoard 内存补丁：关掉的项目仍会保持生效，直到下次重新载入。";
"Extends the lock screen's own dim-then-sleep timer (separate from Settings > Auto-Lock) so you get more time to read notifications. Type the exact seconds, then tap Apply — it writes the SpringBoard preference SBMinimumLockscreenIdleTime (a global floor) and offers a respring to apply it. Like OTA Updates it is a manual action; the value persists across respring and reboot. Tap Remove to restore stock. Run the chain at least once first so kernel access is active." = "延长锁屏自带的“变暗后休眠”计时（与“设置 > 自动锁定”相互独立），让你有更多时间阅读通知。输入精确秒数后点按“应用” — 它会写入 SpringBoard 偏好设置 SBMinimumLockscreenIdleTime（全局下限），并提示重新载入以生效。与 OTA 更新一样，这是手动操作；该值在重新载入和重启后仍会保留。点按“移除”可恢复系统默认。请先至少运行一次链式利用，使内核访问生效。";
"Live overlay. When enabled, StatBar keeps a SpringBoard RemoteCall session open. Refresh rate applies when Cyanide is minimized but the screen is still awake; StatBar pauses while the screen is locked or asleep." = "实时悬浮层。启用后，StatBar 会保持一个 SpringBoard RemoteCall 会话开启。刷新率在 Cyanide 最小化但屏幕仍亮着时生效；屏幕锁定或休眠时 StatBar 会暂停。";
"Tap a box to choose what it shows. NiceBar Lite places plain text in the configured status-bar slots around the notch or Dynamic Island, including the bottom center position. Weather is fetched from your current location through Open-Meteo and follows the Celsius toggle." = "点按某个方框以选择其显示内容。NiceBar Lite 会把纯文本放入刘海或灵动岛周围已配置的状态栏位置，包括底部居中位置。天气通过 Open-Meteo 按你的当前位置获取，并跟随摄氏度开关。";
"RemoteCall-only Axon port. It uses a live app-side loop rather than substrate hooks, so it lasts for the active Cyanide SpringBoard session." = "仅使用 RemoteCall 的 Axon 移植版。它采用 App 侧的实时循环，而非 substrate hook，因此只在当前 Cyanide 的 SpringBoard 会话期间有效。";
"Runtime patch. It changes SpringBoard's app switcher style in memory, writes no system files, and a respring restores stock. Unsupported builds may glitch the app switcher or crash SpringBoard." = "运行时补丁。它在内存中更改 SpringBoard 的多任务切换器样式，不写入任何系统文件，重新载入即可恢复系统默认。不受支持的版本可能导致多任务切换器显示异常或 SpringBoard 崩溃。";
"Replaces the Lock Screen keypad artwork with a style you import here. Every write is verified, and each keypad original is saved before the first change so Restore Original Digits can put the stock art back. Run the chain at least once first so kernel access is active. Lock and unlock (or respring) to see the change; touch and hold Import Originals to erase the saved originals." = "用你在此导入的样式替换锁屏键盘图案。每次写入都会校验，且每个键盘的原始文件都会在首次更改前保存，以便“恢复原始数字”能还原系统图案。请先至少运行一次链式利用，使内核访问生效。锁定再解锁（或重新载入）即可看到变化；长按“导入原始文件”可清除已保存的原始文件。";
