"Replaces a system font in memory: nothing on the sealed system volume changes, and a restart always brings the original back; Restore does it without one (the original is backed up first). Import a .ttf, .otf or .ttc from Files, tap it and pick the font to replace; it has to be the same size or smaller. A plain font is adapted to the system font on the device first (its weights and names, as lara's font patcher does; kerning is dropped if it has to be scaled). Fonts with PostScript (CFF) outlines can't be adapted. Lock Screen Clock changes every clock style at once; the weight slider has no effect on the new font. If SpringBoard keeps crashing after the respring, force-restart the device." = "在内存中替换系统字体：密封的系统卷上不会有任何改动，重启后总会恢复原样；使用“恢复”则无需重启即可还原（会先备份原字体）。从“文件”导入 .ttf、.otf 或 .ttc，点击它并选择要替换的字体；字体必须同样大小或更小。普通字体会先适配设备上的系统字体（字重和名称，与 lara 的字体补丁工具一致；若需缩放则丢弃字距）。使用 PostScript（CFF）轮廓的字体无法适配。锁定屏幕时钟会同时更改所有时钟样式；字重滑块对新字体无效。如果重新载入后 SpringBoard 持续崩溃，请强制重启设备。";
