"The font is %@, larger than the system's %@: it has to fit." = "该字体为 %@，大于系统的 %@：必须能放得下。";
"%@ is '%@'%@ right now, not Apple's font, so it isn't backed up as the original. Restart the device, then try again." = "%@ 当前是“%@”%@，不是 Apple 的字体，因此没有按原始字体备份。请重启设备，然后重试。";
"The original couldn't be backed up (%@); nothing was changed." = "无法备份原始文件（%@）；未做任何改动。";
"%@ can't be used as the %@: %@" = "%@ 不能用作 %@：%@";
"%@ replaced with %@%@. Respring to see it; restart or Restore to undo." = "%@ 已替换为 %@%@。重新载入即可看到；重启设备或使用“恢复”可撤销。";
"The backup isn't Apple's font ('%@'). Restart the device: that always brings the original back." = "备份不是 Apple 的字体（'%@'）。请重启设备：这总能让原始字体恢复。";
"%@ restored. Respring to see it." = "%@ 已恢复。重新载入即可看到。";
"The font has no %@ table." = "该字体没有 %@ 表。";
"scaled from %u to %u units" = "已从 %u 单位缩放到 %u 单位";
"adapted to all %u system fonts" = "已适配全部 %u 个系统字体";
"Backup failed: %@" = "备份失败：%@";
"digit %@ has no art" = "数字 %@ 没有素材";
"no keypad file for digit %@" = "数字 %@ 没有对应的键盘文件";
" %lu file(s) could not be put back (use Restore to retry)." = " %lu 个文件无法还原（请使用“恢复”重试）。";
", %lu original(s) saved" = "，已保存 %lu 个原始文件";
"%lu file(s) in %.1fs%@." = "%lu 个文件，耗时 %.1fs%@。";
"Passcode style applied. %@" = "密码键盘样式已应用。%@";
"Passcode style did not apply cleanly. %@" = "密码键盘样式未能完全应用。%@";
"%@ backup unreadable" = "%@ 备份无法读取";
"%lu file(s) in %.1fs." = "%lu 个文件，耗时 %.1fs。";
"Original digits restored. %@" = "原始数字已恢复。%@";
"%lu file(s) restored, %lu failed in %.1fs: %@. Original backups are retained." = "已恢复 %lu 个文件，%lu 个失败，耗时 %.1fs：%@。原始备份仍然保留。";
"Originals did not restore cleanly. %@" = "原始文件未能完全恢复。%@";
"%@ (over %u bytes or unreadable)" = "%@（超过 %u 字节或无法读取）";
"%@ (copy failed)" = "%@（复制失败）";
"Installed, unsupported here · %@ · %@" = "已安装，此设备不支持 · %@ · %@";
"Installed, unsupported here · %@" = "已安装，此设备不支持 · %@";
"No jailbreak required · v%@" = "无需越狱 · v%@";
"What's New in %@" = "%@ 新功能";
"Digit %@ Saved" = "数字 %@ 已保存";
"%@ System Item" = "%@ 系统项目";
"%@ has configurable options. Set them up first so the tweak applies with your preferences on the first activation." = "%@ 有可配置的选项。请先设置好，这样首次启用时 tweak 就会按你的偏好生效。";
"%ld pending changes" = "%ld 项待处理的更改";
"%ld activate" = "%ld 项启用";
"%ld deactivate" = "%ld 项停用";
"Confirm %ld Changes" = "确认 %ld 项更改";
"%lu package%@" = "%lu 个软件包";
"Your edit was written, but the result couldn't be verified (%s). Reload the file to check it. A backup of its previous contents was kept at:\n%@" = "改动已写入，但无法校验结果（%s）。请重新载入文件确认。其原有内容的备份保留在：\n%@";
"Writing failed (%s), and restoring the previous contents failed too. The file may be damaged. A backup of its previous contents is at:\n%@" = "写入失败（%s），且恢复原有内容也失败了。文件可能已损坏。其原有内容的备份位于：\n%@";
"A save didn't finish (for example because the app or the device stopped mid-write), so these files may be incomplete:%@\n\nTheir previous contents were backed up." = "上次保存未完成（例如应用或设备在写入过程中被中断），因此这些文件可能不完整：%@\n\n它们的原有内容已备份。";
"The folder \"%@\" and everything in it will be deleted." = "文件夹“%@”及其中的全部内容将被删除。";
"\"%@\" will be deleted." = "“%@”将被删除。";
"%@\nCurrent: %@ (%03o). Enter the new mode in octal, e.g. 644 or 755." = "%@\n当前：%@（%03o）。请输入新的八进制权限，例如 644 或 755。";
"%@\n\n… first %lu of %lu bytes shown; too large to edit here." = "%@\n\n… 仅显示前 %lu / %lu 字节；内容过大，无法在此编辑。";
"\"%@\" is already in this dictionary." = "“%@”已在此字典中。";
"Option \"%@\" is given more than once." = "选项“%@”被指定了多次。";
"%@ must be 1 or 0, not \"%@\"." = "%@ 必须是 1 或 0，而不是“%@”。";
"Unknown option \"%@\"." = "未知选项“%@”。";
"Configured floor: %lld seconds.\n\nThis is the value written to SpringBoard (SBMinimumLockscreenIdleTime). It takes effect after a respring." = "已配置的下限：%lld 秒。\n\n这是写入 SpringBoard 的值（SBMinimumLockscreenIdleTime）。重新载入后生效。";
"Delete becomes available in %lds…\n\n%@" = "%ld 秒后可以删除…\n\n%@";
"Could not open the selected archive(s):\n\n%@" = "无法打开所选归档：\n\n%@";
"\"%@\" is now selected. Toggle SnowBoard Lite on and tap Run to apply." = "已选中“%@”。请打开 SnowBoard Lite 开关并点按“运行”以应用。";
"\"%@\" is now selected. Use Apply Style Now below to write it to the keypad." = "已选中“%@”。请使用下方的“立即应用样式”把它写入键盘。";
"Cyanide diagnostic log\nCyanide %@ · iOS %@ · %@" = "Cyanide 诊断日志\nCyanide %@ · iOS %@ · %@";
"Couldn't reach GitHub.\n\n%@" = "无法连接 GitHub。\n\n%@";
"You're on the latest release.\n\nInstalled: %@\nLatest: %@" = "你已经在使用最新版本。\n\n已安装：%@\n最新：%@";
"Not supported on iOS %@. Supported: iOS/iPadOS 17.0-18.7.1 or 26.0-26.0.1." = "不支持 iOS %@。支持的版本：iOS/iPadOS 17.0-18.7.1 或 26.0-26.0.1。";
"%@Run the exploit now? No tweaks are applied, and the log is shown while it runs. It can take a while.\n\nOn A18 / M4 a run can reboot the device (about a 50/50 chance). If it does, just try again." = "%@现在运行漏洞利用吗？不会应用任何 tweak，运行期间会显示日志。这可能需要一段时间。\n\n在 A18 / M4 设备上，一次运行可能导致设备重启（大约 50/50 的概率）。如果发生了，重试即可。";
"Memory: %@ used / %@ total (%@ free)" = "内存：已用 %@ / 共 %@（可用 %@）";
"Make a folder containing PNG files named by app bundle ID:\ncom.apple.mobilesafari.png\ncom.apple.MobileSMS.png\ncom.apple.mobiletimer.png" = "新建一个文件夹，放入以应用 Bundle ID 命名的 PNG 文件：\ncom.apple.mobilesafari.png\ncom.apple.MobileSMS.png\ncom.apple.mobiletimer.png";
"Make a dictionary plist. Each key is a bundle ID. Each value is raw PNG data. Cyanide imports the plist and copies it into Documents/Themes." = "做一个字典 plist：键是 Bundle ID，值是原始 PNG 数据。Cyanide 会导入该 plist 并复制到 Documents/Themes。";
"Adds extra padding and per-icon scaling on top of the stock home/dock layout.\n\nRunning on iOS %ld: the upstream config-mutation path doesn't exist (AMUIInfographIconListLayout has no mutable configuration), so the iOS 26 path instead walks the live SBIconListView/SBIconView hierarchy and adjusts frames + iconImageInfo directly. One-shot at Run; iOS 26 may re-fit on a subsequent layout pass (rotation, page swipe)." = "在原生主屏 / Dock 布局之上增加额外留白与逐图标缩放。\n\n运行于 iOS %ld：上游的配置修改路径不存在（AMUIInfographIconListLayout 没有可变配置），因此 iOS 26 改为直接遍历实时的 SBIconListView/SBIconView 层级，并调整 frame 与 iconImageInfo。仅在点按“运行”时执行一次；iOS 26 可能在后续布局过程中重新适配（旋转、翻页）。";
"A18/M4 only. Pins physical memory so the page after each search mapping is more often ours and valid, lowering the aperture-panic rate. Off uses standard geometry (no pin). Dynamic sizes the pin to live jetsam headroom (75%), adapting per device to avoid the jetsam kill a fixed size can cause. 3 GB is the fixed 1.5.5 size. Effective on the next fresh chain run." = "仅 A18/M4。固定物理内存，使每次搜索映射之后的页更可能属于我们且有效，从而降低 aperture panic 的概率。关闭则使用标准几何布局（不固定）。动态会按实时的 jetsam 余量（75%）调整固定大小，逐设备适配，避免固定大小可能引发的 jetsam 终止。3 GB 是 1.5.5 的固定大小。在下一次全新链式运行时生效。";
"Cyanide waits after each remote call so SpringBoard can settle. Compatible waits 50 ms, Fast 5 ms, Fastest only after calls that leave work running. Most of a tweak's apply time is this wait — Double Tap to Lock spends about 13 waits per Home Screen page. Drop to Fast first; if tweaks still apply correctly, try Fastest. Go back to Compatible if anything misbehaves." = "Cyanide 在每次远程调用后等待一段时间，让 SpringBoard 稳定下来。兼容等待 50 ms，快速 5 ms，最快只在调用留下未完成任务时才等待。tweak 的应用时间大部分都花在这个等待上 — 双击锁屏在每个主屏页大约要等 13 次。先降到快速；如果 tweak 仍能正确应用，再试最快。若有异常，请回到兼容。";
"%@ Date / Time" = "%@ 日期 / 时间";
"Enter %@ to %@.%@%@" = "请输入 %@ 到 %@ 之间的值。%@%@";
"Unknown action \"%@\". Use /toggle, /on or /off." = "未知操作“%@”。请使用 /toggle、/on 或 /off。";
"%@ is saved in Decrypted IPAs.%@" = "%@ 已保存到“已解密的 IPA”。%@";
"%lu file(s) written, %lu failed in %.1fs%@.%@ Failures: %@." = "已写入 %lu 个文件，%lu 个失败，耗时 %.1fs%@。%@ 失败详情：%@。";
"Supervised by %@ (set by Cyanide)." = "由 %@ 监管（由 Cyanide 设置）。";
